@host = https://localhost:44331

### Listar todos
GET {{host}}/api/ProductosApi
Accept: application/json

### Obtener uno
GET {{host}}/api/ProductosApi/1
Accept: application/json

### Crear
POST {{host}}/api/ProductosApi
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Cuaderno",
  "precio": 8.50,
  "stock": 20
}

### Actualizar
PUT {{host}}/api/ProductosApi/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "nombre": "Lourdes",
  "precio": 18.00,
  "stock": 10
}

### Borrar
DELETE {{host}}/api/ProductosApi/1